  "ticker": [
    "WELCOME TO THE 2020 B.B.G.C. \u2014 The covid year. A smaller field: sixteen teams, four groups of four, three rounds apiece. Twelve would make the bracket. Four would not.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 RED \u2014 The defending champions arrived and made a statement. Hawkeyes 3-0, 58 points, untouched. The Seekers took second at 2-1, and I Can't Decide slipped in at 1-2 ahead of winless Guns n Rollers. HAWKEYES, THE SEEKERS and I CAN'T DECIDE advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 BLUE \u2014 Muck Fichigan matched them stride for stride: 3-0 and 61 points, the best mark of the day. Vivace do Tinge went 2-1, Spencer Torkelson 1-2. Balz Deep went home without a win. MUCK FICHIGAN, VIVACE DO TINGE and SPENCER TORKELSON advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 YELLOW \u2014 Nobody could separate. Bel Bocce Vista, Trash n Stache and Dickens Cider ALL finished 2-1, and it came down to points: 58, 56, 43. Three teams in, DeBoccery out at 0-3. BEL BOCCE VISTA, TRASH N STACHE and DICKENS CIDER advance.",
    "GROUP PLAY \u00b7 GREEN \u2014 Covid Cowboys came through the only group nobody could beat outright, finishing 2-0-1. Vandelay Industry 2-1, Bros Boor 1-1-1, and The Boys r Back never got going. COVID COWBOYS, VANDELAY INDUSTRY and BROS BOOR advance.",
    "ROUND ONE \u2014 Dickens Cider ousted The Seekers. Bel Bocce Vista saw off Spencer Torkelson. Vandelay Industry ended I Can't Decide. And Trash n Stache put out Bros Boor. Four gone, eight left, and the giants were waiting.",
    "QUARTERFINALS \u2014 And the giants fell. Muck Fichigan held serve over Dickens Cider, but Bel Bocce Vista upset Vivace do Tinge, Trash n Stache ran through the unbeaten Covid Cowboys, and then the big one: VANDELAY INDUSTRY KNOCKED OUT THE HAWKEYES. The defending champions, 3-0 in the group, out in one game.",
    "SEMIFINALS \u2014 Muck Fichigan turned back Bel Bocce Vista to reach the final unbeaten. And Trash n Stache, who'd already taken down the Covid Cowboys, did it again \u2014 ending Vandelay Industry's giant-killing run. Two teams left.",
    "THE FINAL \u2014 Muck Fichigan: 3-0, 61 points, group champions, two clean bracket wins, not a blemish anywhere. Trash n Stache: out of the three-way logjam in Yellow, and then the hardest road in the tournament \u2014 the undefeated Covid Cowboys AND the team that put out the champions.",
    "\u26a0\ufe0f 2020 \u2014 AND THEN THE RECORD STOPS. Muck Fichigan and Trash n Stache took the mat for the title... and nobody ever wrote down who won. The Winner line on the 2020 bracket is blank to this day. If you were there \u2014 we'd love to know."
  ],
